scp933-duct-tape = Duct Tape
scp933-duct-tape-desc = A roll of silver duct tape. Sticky and versatile.
scp933-master-desc = The first host of the tape. What was a face is only silver edges now.

scp933-tape-mask = SCP-933 face tape
scp933-tape-mask-desc = Silver strips pressed over the eyes. It does not breathe with you.

scp933-victim-face-torn = The tape rips away — your face is gone and your voice with it. You are still yourself; only the mask is gone.
scp933-host-emerged = The tape falls away. What is left hungers.

scp933-tape-already = Their face is already sealed with tape.
scp933-tape-equip-fail = The tape would not stick there.
scp933-peel-start = You start tearing a strip from the roll.
scp933-peel-hand-fail = Your hands are full. The strip crumples and falls apart.
scp933-peel-success = You tear off a usable strip of tape.
scp933-apply-start = You start pressing the strip onto a face.
scp933-apply-success-user = You seal their face with the strip.
scp933-apply-success-target = Tape is pressed tightly across your face.
scp933-rip-start = You start peeling the strip off.
scp933-rip-master-only = Only the current host of SCP-933 can perform the final rip ritual.
scp933-rip-success-user = You tear the strip away.
scp933-rip-success-target = The strip is ripped off your face.